+    <div class="policy-result" role="status" aria-live="polite" style="margin-top:10px;white-space:pre-wrap;"></div>
+    <p class="hint">Both checks are read-only: no posts, URL visits or settings changes. Unknown products are held in strict restricted feeds. All categories with no extra restrictions remains unrestricted. Channels can narrow strict creator rules, never widen them. Category approval does not bypass affiliate, readiness, price or schedule checks.</p>
